WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.691
Once there were two mice, Tony and Rick.

2
00:00:05.692 --> 00:00:12.418
They were cousins. When they were young, they lived together in the country.

3
00:00:12.419 --> 00:00:19.226
When they grew up, Rick moved to the city, but Tony stayed in the country.

4
00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:24.102
Tony loved the country, but Rick did not.

5
00:00:24.103 --> 00:00:31.913
"I love the country. It's clean, it's quiet, and it's safe."

6
00:00:31.914 --> 00:00:36.266
One day Tony got a letter from Rick.

7
00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:40.414
"Rick is coming to visit me here in the country.

8
00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:48.330
This is so fantastic! I can't wait to see my cousin again."

9
00:00:48.331 --> 00:00:50.048
"Hello, Tony."

10
00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:54.245
"Hello, Rick. I missed you very much."

11
00:00:54.246 --> 00:00:57.637
"I have missed you too, cousin."

12
00:00:57.638 --> 00:01:04.759
Now Tony had a very humble house. He lived in the back of an old barn.

13
00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:09.769
He also had little to eat, just a few crumbs.

14
00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:17.380
But he had worked very hard to prepare a nice dinner for his cousin Rick.

15
00:01:17.381 --> 00:01:22.841
"I have made you a very fancy dinner, Rick.

16
00:01:22.842 --> 00:01:30.034
Tonight we will eat some very nice carrots and cabbage."

17
00:01:30.035 --> 00:01:39.205
After dinner was finished, Rick smiled at Tony and said, "Tony, my country cousin, you are very poor.

18
00:01:39.206 --> 00:01:44.711
Your house is nothing but a barn, and you have almost nothing to eat.

19
00:01:44.712 --> 00:01:49.501
In the city I eat cheese, meat, and bread every night."

20
00:01:49.502 --> 00:01:52.410
Tony looked very surprised.

21
00:01:52.411 --> 00:01:59.327
He said with envy, "Cheese, meat, and bread every night?"

22
00:01:59.328 --> 00:02:03.763
"Oh yes. And I live in a beautiful, warm house.

23
00:02:03.764 --> 00:02:06.686
Your barn is cold and dark."

24
00:02:06.687 --> 00:02:10.502
Tony became very envious of the city mouse.

25
00:02:10.503 --> 00:02:14.687
He decided to leave his poor country house.

26
00:02:14.688 --> 00:02:21.523
"I want to live in the city. I want to live in a beautiful, warm house."

27
00:02:21.524 --> 00:02:25.947
"Come with me to the city. You can have all you want." So

28
00:02:25.948 --> 00:02:30.344
the next day, the two mice went to the city. But

29
00:02:30.345 --> 00:02:37.473
Tony didn't like the city. "The city is very dirty and noisy. Where

30
00:02:37.474 --> 00:02:42.205
are the birds? I can't hear them sing." "We

31
00:02:42.206 --> 00:02:44.178
don't have any birds." "Where

32
00:02:44.179 --> 00:02:49.144
are the frogs? I can't hear them croak." "No

33
00:02:49.145 --> 00:02:51.108
frogs here." "Where

34
00:02:51.109 --> 00:02:55.489
is the sun? I don't see it shine." "It's

35
00:02:55.490 --> 00:03:00.444
behind the tall buildings. Would you like to see my beautiful house?" "Of

36
00:03:00.445 --> 00:03:02.901
course." So

37
00:03:02.902 --> 00:03:06.698
off they went to Rick's house. The

38
00:03:06.699 --> 00:03:12.179
house was indeed beautiful and very large. When

39
00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:19.439
Tony saw the house, he was amazed. "What a wonderful house!" "Shh!

40
00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:23.621
You must be very quiet or the woman will see you. If

41
00:03:23.622 --> 00:03:27.507
the woman sees you, she will kill you." Tony

42
00:03:27.508 --> 00:03:33.248
was very afraid. He did not want the woman to see him. "Let's

43
00:03:33.249 --> 00:03:34.539
eat!" When

44
00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:42.268
Tony saw the wonderful pile of food scraps, his eyes almost popped out of his head. "Look

45
00:03:42.269 --> 00:03:50.085
at this food. I have never seen so much food in my life." Tony

46
00:03:50.086 --> 00:03:53.710
began to eat the wonderful food. But

47
00:03:53.711 --> 00:04:00.981
then, bam ! A large broom came crashing down in front of him.

48
00:04:00.982 --> 00:04:07.049
"Run, cousin! Run! If the woman catches you, she will kill you."

49
00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:14.725
Tony ran and he ran and he ran. He ran all the way back to the country.

50
00:04:14.726 --> 00:04:23.110
He was very frightened. He did not stop running until he was safe in his barn.

51
00:04:23.111 --> 00:04:31.416
"I will never go back to the city. I love the country. I am safe here.

52
00:04:31.417 --> 00:04:40.955
It is clean and quiet. I love the birds. I love the frogs. I love the sun."

53
00:04:40.956 --> 00:04:45.826
Tony never ever left the country again.

